   "section": 19,
   "marker": "*19 SECTION - Episode 5 Ending**********************************************",
   "lines": [
    {
     "raw": "]M 008[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Related by your onetime friendship with Buce, you were"
    },
    {
     "raw": "sought out by his people, the Hazudra Collectors, and sent"
    },
    {
     "raw": "to destroy the Zinglonites."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "With none of their forces left and the deadly fruit weapons"
    },
    {
     "raw": "destroyed, the universe as a whole is silent once again.  No"
    },
    {
     "raw": "response ever comes of your inquiry to the state of the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Hazudra or who sent you on this journey.  The secret haunts"
    },
    {
     "raw": "you in your sleep."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Still a hero once again, as always..."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 014[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 041[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Congratulations!"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 031[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Q[",
     "command": "Q"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Tyrian Purple is actually the name of an ancient purple"
    },
    {
     "raw": "dye?  Since they were obtained from vegetables and"
    },
    {
     "raw": "natural sources, dyes were difficult to obtain and"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Tyrian Purple disappeared around the 15th century."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "A Tyrian is the term for a person who lived in the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "city of Tyre."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Ancient Tyre was a large Phonecian seaport from around"
    },
    {
     "raw": "2000BC up until the Romans came around.  It was"
    },
    {
     "raw": "located on the Mediterranean."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Melqart was a Phoenician god and the chief deity of"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Tyre.  He was also called the Tyrian Baal and was"
    },
    {
     "raw": "equated with Nergal, god of the underworld and death."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Shakespeare's Pericles was a prince of Tyre."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Hiram, who appears in the Bible as David and Solomon's"
    },
    {
     "raw": "ally, was a king of Tyre from 969-936BC."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Tyre was finally conquered by Alexander the Great in"
    },
    {
     "raw": "332BC.  After an eight month seige, Alexander drove a"
    },
    {
     "raw": "mole into the sea from the mainland to the island."
    },
    {
     "raw": "Most of the Tyrians were sold into slavery."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Did you know?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Tyre was the site of an artificial harbor built by"
    },
    {
     "raw": "the Phoneicians in the 13th century BC."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    }
   ]
